# ECELL x y kind conn dir pos npos sel on tripped p1 p2 tag ref src p3
# FLOW n kind x y w h op act next no value src target caption   (next / no: node n, 0 = none)
# FLOWX n type low period   (a random node: 0 boolean, 1 byte, 2 integer, 3 float)
MFLOW 2
NAME Belt conveyor system
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 Click SB1: KM1 runs drive U1 and BC-01 runs;\nthe feed gate opens, sand drops through the\nhopper onto the tail end and rides 15 deg up\nto the head, where it falls into the bin.\nSB0 / ES1 stop it; the gate shuts with it.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Turn RV1 (wheel): faster or slower belt.\nSelect BC-01: change its Incline (-35..35).\nFault BC-01 (Properties): it stops on the\nslope and the feed gate shuts.

